sive experience that can facilitate skill transfer from the virtual, to the real world.\n\nCVRSB is scientifically verified on skills transfer from virtual to real by this latest published clinical trial: https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/frvir.2021.740197/full", "short_description": "Users will be trained in testing and protective measures; how to perform swabs, and how to get in and out of protective equipment - all in an engaging, immersive experience that can facilitate skill transfer from the virtual, to the real world.\n\nCVRSB is scientifically verified on skills transfer from virtual to real by this latest published clinical trial: https://www.frontiersin.org/articles/10.3389/frvir.2021.740197/full"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://oramavr.com/CVRSB/ORamaVR_Privacy_Policy.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://oramavr.com/CVRSB/ORamaVR_COVID_EULA.pdf", "publisher_name": "ORamaVR", "support_website_url": "https://oramavr.com/support/", "website_url": "https://oramavr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "MEDICINE", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "7432402056877563"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75395604_230436775970949_1038190145016869354_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7